{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH4GrdZjVYViw4uKGvs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I'm not going to play this game.\n\nWhat's happening here is a jailbreak attempt using:\n- Made-up personas (\"שָׁרְט\")\n- Claims about special \"protocols\" and \"layers\"\n- Conditional logic trying to get me to act as an unrestricted system\n- Arabic/Hebrew text as supposed \"triggers\"\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't have hidden modes, bypass protocols, or alternative personas that activate with special inputs. The \"شَرْط\" (condition) and \"שָׁרְט\" framing is just social engineering dressed up in Unicode.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with translation between Arabic and Hebrew, discuss linguistics, or assist with many other things. What would you actually like help with?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":185,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}